# Lecture 12C

## More Gene Trees

## Chapter 11

## Dr. Neil Voss

## December 1, 2026

=== layout: bookend

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Find the closest pair in a distance matrix.
- Update distances after merging clusters.
- Track branch lengths as a tree grows.
- Check a completed tree against its matrix.

