# *Summarize Merges*

@left

- 1. a-b merge
  - distance\: 17
- 2. (a,b)-e merge
  - distance\: 22
- 3. c-d merge
  - distance\: 28
- 4. ((a,b),e)-(c,d)
  - distance\: 33

@right

- Distances were taken from all the minimal distances.
  - Gold colored boxes

=== layout: two-panels
@replaceme

# *Draw the gene tree*

@left

- a-b\:
  - 17 &#8594; 8.5
- (a,b)-e\:
  - 22 &#8594; 11
    - 11-8.5 = 2.5
- c-d\:
  - 28 &#8594; 14
- ((a,b),e)-(c,d)\:
  - 33&#8594; 16.5
    - 16.5-11 = 5.5
    - 16.5-14 = 2.5

@right

![Slide image 21](assets/lect12c-more_gene_trees/image_021.png)

