=== layout: one-panel
@replaceme


@body

![Slide image 31](assets/lect12c-more_gene_trees/image_031.jpg)

- *Gene trees may not coincide with species trees*

- A gene tree may not coincide with a species tree because of the sorting of polymorphic alleles in the different lineages.

=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- Start with the smallest distance in the matrix.
- Update the matrix after each merge.
- Keep earlier branches when adding a new cluster.
- Check the final tree against the original distances.

